From 3f3e5e56603daac956ca6fd1065220ee9bafa0e0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: GCSA-aegis <aegis@gcsa.local>
Date: Thu, 13 Aug 2026 05:25:25 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Aegis: score phishing URLs with explainable heuristics

Port packages/core scorePhishingUrl() into C++ so the interstitial
blocks brand-spoof / suspicious-TLD / punycode hosts, not only seed
rules, and show reason codes on the warning page.
---
